      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Download an image and post it to Instagram\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Downloads the image from the given URL into binary data.\n3. Publishes a post to Instagram via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] Select your Instagram account in the Publish to Instagram node.\n- [ ] Make sure an upstream node provides the image as binary data for Instagram.\n- [ ] Replace the example caption in the Publish to Instagram node with your own text.\n- [ ] Point the Download image node at your own image URL.\n\n### Customization\n\nReplace the example content, then run the workflow whenever you want to post.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 568
      },
